Dataset: wsmed_examples (data/wsmed_examples.rda)

Source: Roberto Sagaribay (2025), iWeek: A Week-Long Social Media Abstinence
Intervention and its Impact on Well-Being, Mental Health, Body Image, and Sleep
in Latina College Students. Mendeley Data, version 1.
https://doi.org/10.17632/fn9n95bsh5.1

