https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Modifications by the wsMed manuscript authors: retain the 14 example variables;
recalculate BMI using 703 * weight_lb / height_in^2, accepting heights within
48--84 inches and leaving 13 ambiguous/out-of-range heights with missing BMI.
The package copy removes SPSS storage attributes but preserves every numerical
value, participant row, and missing value from the prepared replication file.
The data are illustrative, not a replication of the source study's analyses.

